---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../../components/SectionHeader.astro";

const updatedAt = "2026-10-09";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — LagosLifeGuide.app"
  description="How LagosLifeGuide.app handles data: no accounts, planner data stays in your browser, and what our analytics tools collect."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-margin py-space-xl md:px-margin-tablet lg:px-margin-desktop">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="Legal"
        title="Privacy Policy"
        subtitle={`Last updated: ${updatedAt}.`}
      />

      <div class="mt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">The short version</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            LagosLifeGuide.app is a small, independent, read-mostly website. We do not run user
            accounts, we do not ask you to log in, and the planning tool stores its data in your
            own browser — not on our servers. The only data we receive is basic, aggregate
            analytics described below.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">No accounts, no server-side personal data</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            Nothing on this site requires registration. We do not collect names, emails, passwords,
            or any other account data, and we have no database of users. Feedback you choose to
            submit (optional contact field aside) is used only to fix issues. If you email us at
            support@lagoslifeguide.app yourself, your address is used only to reply.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Planner data stays in your browser</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            The First Week Planner saves your inputs and plans using your browser's localStorage.
            That data never leaves your device, is not transmitted to us, and you can delete it at
            any time by clearing your browser's site data. Uninstalling or clearing site data
            removes it permanently — we cannot recover it because we never had it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Analytics</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            We plan to add privacy-respecting analytics (Google Analytics 4 and/or Plausible) to
            understand which pages are useful. In general terms, these tools collect:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-space-sm flex list-disc flex-col gap-space-xs pl-space-md">
            <li>Pages visited and approximate time on page.</li>
            <li>Approximate geographic region (country/city level) and language.</li>
            <li>Device, browser, and screen-size category.</li>
            <li>Referring site or search terms that brought you here.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            Plausible is configured to be cookieless and does not track you across websites.
            Google Analytics 4 may use cookies and process data on Google's servers; see Google's
            privacy documentation for details. Neither tool receives anything you type into the
            planner, because that data never reaches us at all.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Feedback submissions</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            If you send feedback through the feedback button (bottom-right of every page), your
            message — along with the page it was sent from — is stored by our self-hosted feedback
            service and forwarded to the maintainers. It is kept only as long as needed to verify
            and act on the report, and is never sold or shared with third parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Third-party content</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            Pages may link to external game sites and sources (for example, the official game
            instance). Those sites have their own privacy practices, which we do not control.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-headline-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Changes and contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-space-sm">
            If this policy changes, the updated date above will change. Questions about privacy can
            be sent to the site operator at{" "}
            <a href="mailto:support@lagoslifeguide.app" class="font-semibold text-primary transition-colors hover:text-brand-dark">
              support@lagoslifeguide.app
            </a>
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
